{"id":"envi_o","lemma":"envío","pos":"noun","rank":2783,"glosses":["shipment, sending"],"ipa":"/emˈbio/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"envíos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-env%C3%ADo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Hay cargo por el envío?","en":"Is there a delivery charge?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587328","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"charge, burden"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Escribo cartas que nunca envío.","en":"I write letters which I never send.","words":[{"g":"to write","l":"escribir"},{"g":"letter","l":"carta"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"never"},null]},{"text":"Tiene que haberse roto durante el envío.","en":"It must've been broken during shipping.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422688","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"El envío de correos en ese país no es veloz.","en":"Mail service in that country is not quick.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"post office"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"country"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"fast, quick, speedy"}]},{"text":"En caso que el envío se retrase, contamos con un seguro especial de retrasos.","en":"In case the shipment is delayed, we have special delay insurance.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,null,{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to delay","l":"retrasar"},{"g":"to count","l":"contar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"secure"},{"g":"special"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"delay","l":"retraso"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"in the event"]]}]}